{"id":"word:hebrew:H3303","type":"word","title":"יָפֶה","subtitle":"H3303 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"beautiful (literally or figuratively)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יָפֶה (H3303) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 43 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יָפֶה (yâpheh) means beautiful (literally or figuratively) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 1 3."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יָפֶה","transliteration":"yâpheh","pronunciation":"yaw-feh'","strong":"H3303","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3303","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["יְפֵ֥ה","יְפַת","יָפֶ֣ה","הַ/יָּפָ֖ה","יָפָ֔ה"],"morphs":[["HAafsa",12],["HAamsc",7],["HAamsa",5],["HAafsc",5],["HTd/Aafsa",3],["HC/Aafsc",2],["HAafpc",2],["HAafsc/Sp1cs",2],["HTd/Aafpa",1],["HC/Aamsc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"beautiful (literally or figuratively)","usage":"beautiful, beauty, comely, fair(-est, one), goodly, pleasant, well.","full":"H3303. yapheh יָפֶה adjective fair, beautiful ; — masculine absolute יָפֶה 2Sam 14:25 4 t.; construct יְפֵה Gen 39:6 (twice in verse) + 6 t.; feminine יָפָה 12:14 14 t.; construct יְפַת ; 2:11 + 6 t.; suffix יָפָתִי Song 2:10 , 13 ; plural יָפוֺת Job 42:15 ; Amos 8:13 ; construct יְפוֺת Gen 41:2 ; יְפֹת 41:4 ; 41:18 ; &#8212; fair, beautiful , as attribute of woman 2Sam 13:1 ; 1Kin 1:3 ; Amos 8:13 ; Prov 11:22 ; compare Job 42:15 ; Song 6:10 ( ׳י כלבנה ); predicate Gen 12:14 ; 1Kin 1:4 ; Song 1:15 (twice in verse); 4:1 (twice in verse); Cant 4:17; 6:4; = substantive fair one 1:8 ; 2:10 , 13 ; 5:9 ; 6:1 ; often construct מַרְאֶה יְפַתֿ Gen 12:11 ; 29:17 ; 2Sam 14:27 ; יְפַתתֹּֿאַר Gen 29:17 ; 1Sam 25:3 ; Deut 21:11 ; Est 2:7 : of kine יְפוֺתמַֿרְאֶה Gen 41:2 , compare 41:4 ; יְפוֺתתֹּֿאַר 41:18 ; less often of boy, young man יָפֶה אִישׁ 2Sam 14:25 ; predicate Song 1:16 ; תֹאַר יְפֵה Gen 39:6 ; מַרְאֶה וִיפֵה 39:6 (of Joseph); of Jerusalem נוֺף יְפֵה Psa 48:3 ; of a singer קוֺל יְפֵה Ezek 33:32 ; of trees: olive פְרִיתֹֿאַר יְפֵה Jer 11:16 ; cedar (figurative of Egypt) עָנָף יְפֵה Ezek 31:3 , compare 31:9 ; יָפֶה of everything in its time Eccl 3:11 ; of various Acts 5:17 . &#8212; In עִם עֵינַיִם יְפֵה 1Sam 16:12 , מַרְאֶה יְפֵה עִם 17:42 , either יפה = substantive abstract with beauty of eyes , or עִם is textual error (Gr Krenkel ZAW, 1882, 309 Bu עֶלֶם youth ), see Dr.","rootNote":"from 3302 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 1 3","keyReferences":["1Kgs 1 3","1Kgs 1 4","1Sam 16 12","1Sam 17 42","1Sam 25 3","2Sam 13 1","2Sam 14 25","2Sam 14 27"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":43,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 1 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָפָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAafsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 4","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָפָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAafsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 16 12","book":"1Sam","chapter":16,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְפֵ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 17 42","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְפֵ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וִ֣/יפַת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Aafsc"},{"reference":"2Sam 13 1","book":"2Sam","chapter":13,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָפָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAafsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 14 25","book":"2Sam","chapter":14,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָפֶ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 14 27","book":"2Sam","chapter":14,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְפַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAafsc"},{"reference":"Amos 8 13","book":"Amos","chapter":8,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יָּפ֛וֹת","sourc